#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Kom godt i gang"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the |prodname| Server Installation Guide. This guide describes"
" the installation tasks for |prodname|, the managed file synchronization "
"and sharing solution."
msgstr "Velkommen til |prodname| Server Installationsguiden. Denne guide beskriver installationsopgaverne for |prodname|, løsningen til håndteret filsynkronisering og deling."

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid ""
"|prodname| includes the |prodname| server, which runs on the Microsoft "
"Windows server platform, and client agent applications for Web browsers, "
"Microsoft Windows, Mac OS X, and for mobile platforms such as the Android"
" and the Apple iOS operating systems."
msgstr "|prodname| inkluderer |prodname|-serveren, som kører på Microsoft Windows-serverplatformen, og klientagentapplikationer til webbrowsere, Microsoft Windows, Mac OS X og til mobile platforme som Android og Apples iOS-operativsystemer."

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Oversigt"

#: ../../index.rst:15
msgid ""
"|prodname| is a managed file sync and share solution that focuses on "
"local file server cloud-enablement. It differentiates from other file "
"sync and share solutions (EFSS) by focusing on the security, control, "
"file server and team collaboration. |prodname| does really well in the "
"following areas:"
msgstr "|prodname| er en administreret filsynkroniserings- og delingsløsning, der fokuserer på cloud-aktivering af lokale filservere. Den adskiller sig fra andre filsynkroniserings- og delingsløsninger (EFSS) ved at fokusere på sikkerhed, kontrol, filservere og team-samarbejde. |prodname| klarer sig virkelig godt på følgende områder:"

#: ../../index.rst:17
msgid ""
"maintain security by migrating files and folders while keeping the NTFS "
"permissions intact."
msgstr "oprethold sikkerheden ved at migrere filer og mapper samtidig med at NTFS-tilladelserne bevares intakte."

#: ../../index.rst:18
msgid ""
"provide on-demand access that honors read-only and write permission in "
"real-time."
msgstr "giver adgang efter behov, der respekterer læse- og skrivetilladelser i realtid."

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid ""
"mirror local network shares on file servers to allow for team "
"collaboration in the cloud."
msgstr "spejl lokale netværksdelinger på filservere for at tillade teamsamarbejde i skyen."

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid "provide virtual drive letter mapping to the files and folders for access."
msgstr "tilvejebringe virtuel drevbogstavstilknytning til filer og mapper for adgang."

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"provide file locking, version control, client encryption, and more "
"advanced features for managing all virtual drives."
msgstr "tilbyder filspærring, versionskontrol, klientkryptering og flere avancerede funktioner til håndtering af alle virtuelle drev."

#: ../../index.rst:23
msgid ""
"|prodname| Server is a software built on top of the Microsoft Web "
"Platform:"
msgstr "|prodname| Server er en software bygget oven på Microsofts webplatform:"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "Windows Server"
msgstr "Windows Server"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid "IIS (Internet Information Server)"
msgstr "IIS (Internet Information Server)"

#: ../../index.rst:27
msgid ".NET Framework and ASP.NET"
msgstr ".NET Framework og ASP.NET"

#: ../../index.rst:28
msgid "WCF (Windows Communication Foundation)"
msgstr "WCF (Windows Communication Foundation)"

#: ../../index.rst:29
msgid "PostgreSQL, MySQL or SQL Server"
msgstr "PostgreSQL, MySQL eller SQL Server"

#: ../../index.rst:31
msgid ""
"Since the |prodname| Server is built on top of the Microsoft Web "
"Platform, it integrates very well with other Microsoft components such as"
" the NTFS Permission on files and folders, the Active Directory users and"
" the File Server network shares."
msgstr "Da |prodname| Server er bygget oven på Microsofts webplatform, integrerer den meget godt med andre Microsoft-komponenter såsom NTFS-tilladelser på filer og mapper, Active Directory-brugere og netværksdelinger på filserveren."

#: ../../index.rst:33
msgid ""
"It provides file access and sharing functionality through client agents "
"for PCs, Macs, File Servers, Web Browsers, and Mobile Devices. The client"
" agent software on Windows and Mac provides real drive mapping and volume"
" mounting support that contains advanced optimization for WAN(Wide Area "
"Network) data transfer."
msgstr "Den giver adgang til og deling af filer via klientagenter til pc'er, Macs, filservere, webbrowsere og mobile enheder. Klientagentsoftwaren på Windows og Mac tilbyder rigtig drevtilkobling og volumenmontering, som indeholder avanceret optimering til WAN (Wide Area Network) datatransmission."

#: ../../index.rst:35
msgid ""
"The services can be deployed in flexible combinations to meet different "
"needs. There are two primary ways to deploy the |prodname| Server:"
msgstr "Tjenesterne kan implementeres i fleksible kombinationer for at opfylde forskellige behov. Der er to primære måder at implementere |prodname| Server på:"

#: ../../index.rst:37
msgid ""
"Deploy in the same site as the File Servers and Active Directory domain "
"controllers:"
msgstr "Udrul i samme site som filserverne og Active Directory-domænecontrollere:"

#: ../../index.rst:41
msgid "See also:"
msgstr "Se også:"

#: ../../index.rst:43
msgid ""
"`File Server Remote Access <https://www.gladinet.com/hybrid-cloud-with-"
"file-server.html>`_"
msgstr "`Fjernadgang til filserver <https://www.gladinet.com/hybrid-cloud-with-file-server.html>`_"

#: ../../index.rst:45
msgid ""
"Deploy in a site remotely, such as Amazon Web Services EC2, Microsoft "
"Azure, or in a Data Center where the Managed Service Provider (MSP) hosts"
" their infrastructure:"
msgstr "Implementer på et fjernsted, såsom Amazon Web Services EC2, Microsoft Azure eller i et datacenter, hvor Managed Service Provider (MSP) er vært for deres infrastruktur:"

#: ../../index.rst:50
msgid "System Components"
msgstr "Systemkomponenter"

#: ../../index.rst:52
msgid ""
"There are three different system components (logical components that can "
"co-exist in the same server) in the |prodname| server. In the smallest "
"depl oyment unit, the three different components can co-exist in one "
"single machine (all-in-one deployment)."
msgstr "Der er tre forskellige systemkomponenter (logiske komponenter, der kan sameksistere på samme server) i |prodname| serveren. I den mindste udrulningsenhed kan de tre forskellige komponenter sameksistere i én enkelt maskine (alt-i-én udrulning)."

#: ../../index.rst:57
msgid "1. Web Server Component - The |prodname| Server"
msgstr "Webserverkomponent - |prodname| Serveren"

#: ../../index.rst:58
msgid ""
"The Web Server component is ASP.NET and WFC code that is hosted by IIS on"
" a Windows Server. The Web Server component is actually comprised of two "
"separate \"sub-components\":"
msgstr "Webserverkomponenten er ASP.NET og WFC-kode, der hostes af IIS på en Windows Server. Webserverkomponenten består faktisk af to separate \"underkomponenter\":"

#: ../../index.rst:60
msgid "Web Node"
msgstr "Webnode"

#: ../../index.rst:61
msgid "Worker Node"
msgstr "Arbejder Node"

#: ../../index.rst:63
msgid ""
"These sub-components exist for historical purposes and there are still "
"elements in the Cluster Manager user interface for configuring these sub-"
"components."
msgstr "Disse underkomponenter eksisterer af historiske årsager, og der er stadig elementer i brugergrænsefladen for Cluster Manager til konfiguration af disse underkomponenter."

#: ../../index.rst:66
msgid "2. Database - Configuration Information and System Log"
msgstr "2. Database - Konfigurationsoplysninger og systemlog"

#: ../../index.rst:68
msgid ""
"The database contains persistent information for the system. This "
"persistent information includes static configuration information such as "
"user name, file storage and active directory connection information. The "
"database also stores dynamic information such as activity log, file "
"change log and audit traces."
msgstr "Databasen indeholder vedvarende information for systemet. Denne vedvarende information inkluderer statisk konfigurationsinformation såsom brugernavn, filopbevaring og oplysninger om forbindelse til aktivitetsfortegnelsen. Databasen gemmer også dynamisk information såsom aktivitetslog, filændringslog og revisionspor."

#: ../../index.rst:70
msgid ""
"|prodname| supports the MySQL and Microsoft SQL Server Database "
"Management Systems (DMBS). The all-in-one deployment will deploy MySQL "
"Community Edition on the |prodname| server. The all-in-one deployment is "
"useful for evaluating the software but an external database server is "
"recommended for Production deployments."
msgstr "|prodname| understøtter MySQL og Microsoft SQL Server Database Management Systems (DBMS). Den alt-i-én-installation vil installere MySQL Community Edition på |prodname|-serveren. Den alt-i-én-installation er nyttig til evaluering af softwaren, men en ekstern databaseserver anbefales til produktionsmiljøer."

#: ../../index.rst:73
msgid "3. Back-end File Storage - Where Files and Folders are Stored"
msgstr "3. Backend-filopbevaring - Hvor filer og mapper opbevares"

#: ../../index.rst:75
msgid ""
"The back-end file storage component is the persistent storage location "
"for files and folders. There are two different types of storage services."
" One is managed by |prodname|, such as the default storage for the "
"cluster and the default storage for tenants. The other is imported "
"storage, for example, existing file server network shares that weren't "
"managed by |prodname| but can be imported to |prodname| for remote and "
"mobile access."
msgstr "Back-end filopbevaringskomponenten er det vedvarende opbevaringssted for filer og mapper. Der findes to forskellige typer af lagringstjenester. Den ene administreres af |prodname|, såsom standardlagringen for klyngen og standardlagringen for lejere. Den anden er importeret lagring, for eksempel eksisterende filservernetværksdelinger, som ikke blev administreret af |prodname|, men som kan importeres til |prodname| for fjern- og mobiladgang."

